# VoAIs Indic Calling Agent
Region: asia-south1 (Mumbai)
GPU zone: asia-south1-c  (G4 sirf isi zone me hai)

## Nodes
- A: g4-standard-48, 1x NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB, no public IP.
  Ek hi node, A1+A2 dono replace karta hai.
    Gemma-4-E4B-it-qat (ya 12B)  -> port 8000
      audio seedha leta hai, alag STT ki zaroorat nahi
    IndicF5 TTS                  -> port 8002   (11 Indian langs)
    IndicConformer STT           -> port 8001   (fallback, agar Gemma ka
                                   Tamil/Telugu ASR kamzor nikla)
    Human-1 (VoiceArena)         -> port 8003   (experimental, Hindi S2S)
      co-loaded rahega, production traffic nahi

  VRAM: Gemma ~11.5 + IndicF5 1.4 + Human-1 31 = ~44 GB / 96 GB

- B: e2-standard-4, public static IP.
  Chalega: Asterisk + Node orchestrator + VoAIs app.

## Network
Ek VPC, asia-south1. A private only.
Sirf B usse baat karega, ports 8000-8003 pe.

## Latency target
Cascade on G4: ~570 ms   (11 languages, tools chalte hain)   <- production
Human-1 + LLM parallel: ~400 ms  (Hindi only)                 <- baad me
Human-1 akela: ~300 ms   (Hindi, no tools)                    <- experiment

## Hatae gaye (kyun)
- L4 24GB          : 300 GB/s bandwidth bottleneck, decode dhima
- T4 node          : alag STT node ki zaroorat nahi, Gemma audio khud leta hai
- Qwen3.6-35B-A3B  : 25.5 GB AWQ, audio input nahi, 4 stage wapas aa jate
- Magpie TTS       : 12 langs me sirf Hindi Indian hai
